    "title":  "Unify A132 and B4 with project-wide Python retirement",
    "summary":  "Human-governor directive: remove the two B4 responsibility exception from A132 and align its referenced B4 with the already effective complete retirement in B73/B74. Law/data only; no implementation changes.",
    "requested_by":  "decision-sovereign",
    "origin":  "Direct human-governor instruction 2026-10-02: 統一 Python 規則，A132 改為全面退役，只改法典不實作。",
    "problem":  {
                    "summary":  "A132 and referenced B4 preserve two request-scoped Python roles that conflict with B73/B74 zero-role and zero-residency retirement."
                },
    "change_class":  "architecture-authority",
    "required_review":  "five-sovereign-audit-unanimous-pass",
